                "edit": {
                    "label": "Edit",
                    "tooltip": "Edit the selected product"
                }
            },
            "example": "A self-managing page: header actions, search, table and pagination wired to the demo backend, with create and edit in a modal form. The Available tab is a view: the same list with a filter of its own, searchable too. The headers sort the list and the columns menu hides the category or the price. The Owner column names who each product belongs to, and the filters panel offers to filter by owner once the products have two owners or more.",
            "folders": {
                "actions": {
                    "move": {
                        "label": "Move to...",
                        "tooltip": "Move the selected rows to another folder"
                    }
                },
                "categories": {
                    "root": "All products"
                },
                "example": "With categories the page browses folders, and the last node of the breadcrumb counts what the folder holds, folders and products across every page. Leaving for a route under the page and coming back keeps the folder, the search, the page and the selection. Drag a product, or the selected rows, onto a folder to move them there; the Move to... action does the same from the keyboard. Where rows have owners, both offer only the folders of the owner of the rows, and a selection of several owners cannot move. The headers sort the list on the backend.",
                "heading": "Folders",
                "move": {
                    "title": "Move to"
                },
